+/**
+ * Runtime identity admission (issue #10).
+ *
+ * A task records the digest of the extension distribution it was admitted under,
+ * and every path that would run or advance it re-checks that digest. These tests
+ * use the real loader against real files, so the digest comes from bytes on disk
+ * rather than from a hand-built fixture.
+ */
